    {
      "id": "page_ledger",
      "title": "A seal shared by both routes",
      "text_script": {
        "pointer_type": "String Constant",
        "script_element_type": "Pointer",
        "value": "Mara turns the brass ledger toward you. \"The seal is the smallest residue reachable by multiplying the current state by twos and threes modulo thirteen. Both possible starts carry seal one, and the seal stays fixed as the mechanism ticks.\" The ledger certifies that the same arithmetic class contains both routes. It gives you the same entry whichever chamber holds the ration. You can still pay for one lamp reading before choosing."
      },
