      "title": "At the handles",
      "text_script": {
        "pointer_type": "String Constant",
        "script_element_type": "Pointer",
        "value": "The west handle is marked with a single point. Two interlocked rings mark the east. Mara keeps her hands away from both. \"You have the two possible starts and an equal prior,\" she says. \"Opening either chamber ends the attempt.\" You have spent nothing on a sample. The unseen mechanism determines which handle releases the ration."
      },
